{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「周遊列國也是一種工作」。陳冠希舊愛謝熙婷Cammi（前名謝芷蕙）16歲時因與陳冠希的舌吻照流出而爆紅。雖然其後因𡃁模熱潮退去而淡出娛樂圈，但她仍然十分勤力在另一方面發展。被外界認為是「網紅」的她，多年來依然獲外界關注，出身公屋的她顯然是「投資有道」，經常分享極奢華生活，出入五星級酒店，擁有過百萬的Hermès手袋及環遊世界。</p><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 飛到現場睇世界盃。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834967299756032348712.png/5v-tN1XrI8xDgAF1fuNrIgz1ukR2GbLP9a7AG_WuwBs\"/><figcaption>Cammi 飛到現場睇世界盃。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 身材愈嚟愈好。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834969678057472168045.png/RJszaVAo75UBjh3viiZdwVox_piAXk2JP9jZPz_Y2T8\"/><figcaption>Cammi 身材愈嚟愈好。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi 坐私人飛機，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834972429651968216845.png/G7nyNLwy0ghotykfjb90dA5XT4eJgalIUVtY3VFbWN0\"/><figcaption>Cammi 坐私人飛機，真係識嘆。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Cammi生活富貴。（ig@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260706/1150834974845702144450381.png/uU7sb9cPpu3uBo8ZCRdye1dfD0NbYHiqo9ItRqPSLUY\"/><figcaption>Cammi生活富貴。（ig@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><p>由公屋到富貴生活</p><p>近日世界盃熱潮，Cammi自不然不會錯過，與朝九晚五的香港上班族不同，她專程飛到當地，更坐在前排近距離欣賞球賽！除此之外，出入坐豪車不在話下，就連飛到當地都是坐私人飛機，認真識嘆！由公屋小女孩，搖身一變成為生活優渥的網紅，可想而知背後需要付出多少努力。</p><figure><img alt=\"好身材！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025048453568270336852369.jpeg/u6HHxPiWAZNw6ATcuArSqrA4bNKAn5xYA80zBAPNMwQ\"/><figcaption>好身材！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"厲害！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250409/986651215645904896163978.jpeg/3fU9pErX_eLxEhiRa-MXO-oktR1jQrIoUd7R61He0es\"/><figcaption>厲害！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生活富貴！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025048656870379520604257.jpeg/VES1xoPywBQgbO6z-YiSjwxJELJkt5EBqy_Jv6svyb8\"/><figcaption>生活富貴！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好好！（IG/@cbbheree）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250724/1025049731388280832931568.jpeg/2-voed5WYbuPpnQW3DLHL1EE4TcN9QHAocOIP6HDiD8\"/><figcaption>Keep得好好！（IG/@cbbheree）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T02:59:15.449179+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}